moment I saw Mount Bromo. Mount Bromo is an active volcano on Java and I'd never seen something like this in my life. I'd never been to the moon as most people have and not been to, but the landscape was seemed like it would be you know what you'd be like on the moon. And I was surrounded by volcanoes all around me, fires kind of just coming from the ground. And it was an otherworldly experience. It was tremendous. And we spent a good 36 hours there. And I now see that the effort was so worth it to see this sight.
